1
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:15,030
Being a woman is hard.

2
00:00:16,870 --> 00:00:17,960
Learn makeup.

3
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:21,920
Learn styling.

4
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:27,440
Practice smiling in the mirror
so it looks attractive.

5
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,880
Learn how to speak so people like you.

6
00:00:35,070 --> 00:00:36,560
But not too likable.

7
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:40,320
Otherwise, people will condemn you.

8
00:00:46,640 --> 00:00:48,070
Being ugly is a woman's original sin.

9
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:53,710
Being too beautiful is one too.

10
00:00:56,350 --> 00:00:57,320
Hard to understand, right?

11
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,710
After all,

12
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,310
only women get it.

13
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:25,600
[Fragments of Truth]

14
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:29,190
[Episode 1]

15
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,430
It's me, A-Jun.

16
00:02:36,120 --> 00:02:36,910
A-Jun.

17
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,470
It's me.

18
00:02:42,630 --> 00:02:43,190
A-Jun.

19
00:03:12,560 --> 00:03:13,190
Where's A-Jun?

20
00:04:49,190 --> 00:04:49,560
Captain Ren.

21
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:50,190
Mm.

22
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:55,720
Uncle He.

23
00:04:55,870 --> 00:04:56,160
Yes?

24
00:04:58,830 --> 00:04:59,750
Captain Ren. Uncle He.

25
00:04:59,830 --> 00:05:00,040
Mm.

26
00:05:01,120 --> 00:05:01,950
What's going on?

27
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:03,310
The victim is Zou Jun.

28
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,270
Middle-aged male.

29
00:05:04,800 --> 00:05:06,870
Estimated time of death is around 1 a.m.

30
00:05:07,390 --> 00:05:11,070
A sharp object pierced his genitals,
causing fatal blood loss.

31
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:49,600
Based on the scene,

32
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:52,510
the drag marks on the floor
were left while he was still alive.

33
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:54,160
The killer was strong.

34
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,720
Even if the killer is a woman,

35
00:05:55,870 --> 00:05:58,120
she'd be at least 1.7 meters tall.

36
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:16,070
The killer first used a short blade
to torture the victim.

37
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:24,390
No.

38
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:25,270
Wait.

39
00:06:26,270 --> 00:06:27,240
Not a short blade.

40
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,600
The blade was likely thinner
and sharper.

41
00:06:30,830 --> 00:06:32,000
That way, with comparable injuries,

42
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,950
the victim could stay alive longer

43
00:06:34,360 --> 00:06:35,920
and endure more suffering.

44
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:01,160
The victim suffered severe injuries
to his genitals.

45
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:03,160
That ultimately killed him.

46
00:07:16,750 --> 00:07:17,160
Han Ning.

47
00:07:19,070 --> 00:07:19,430
Come here.

48
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:23,040
Han Ning.

49
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,430
Captain Ren.

50
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,360
Captain Ren.

51
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:28,430
So you're Han Ning.

52
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,480
What were you looking at?

53
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,870
I was trying to see things
from the killer's perspective

54
00:07:35,430 --> 00:07:36,240
and reconstruct the crime.

55
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:39,390
Tell me what you've got.

56
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,190
The killer was most likely a woman,

57
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,950
possibly with manual labor experience,

58
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:46,120
or someone who works out regularly.

59
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,950
She's very strong.

60
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:49,000
The victim's face was heavily made up.

61
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,720
His face had been slashed repeatedly.

62
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,000
But the cuts were precise.

63
00:07:52,270 --> 00:07:54,950
The precise cuts looked like

64
00:07:55,160 --> 00:07:55,950
deliberate disfigurement to vent rage.

65
00:07:56,270 --> 00:07:57,800
Then, after doing all that,

66
00:07:58,600 --> 00:08:00,270
while he was still alive,

67
00:08:00,270 --> 00:08:01,070
she cut off his genitals,

68
00:08:01,190 --> 00:08:01,750
killing him.

69
00:08:02,950 --> 00:08:04,390
Put that way,

70
00:08:04,630 --> 00:08:06,600
she's a total psychopath.

71
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,920
We can't dismiss this
as mere perversion.

72
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,000
This was more likely
premeditated murder.

73
00:08:13,190 --> 00:08:13,680
Captain Ren.

74
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:14,510
The caller is here.

75
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:15,040
Mm.

76
00:08:17,270 --> 00:08:17,800
Everyone, clear out.

77
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:18,680
Police business.

78
00:08:19,270 --> 00:08:19,750
Thanks.

79
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:23,160
Captain Ren.

80
00:08:23,630 --> 00:08:24,070
That's him.

81
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:25,360
You're Xu?

82
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:28,950
I'm Xu Haodong.

83
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,560
How did you know Zou Jun?

84
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:31,920
Why were you looking for him?

85
00:08:32,670 --> 00:08:34,120
We were just acquaintances.

86
00:08:34,550 --> 00:08:36,390
He owed me some money.

87
00:08:36,390 --> 00:08:37,440
He texted me yesterday.

88
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:38,000
So I came to see him.

89
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:38,910
How much did he owe you?

90
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,120
20,000 yuan.

91
00:08:41,120 --> 00:08:41,670
Not much.

92
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:42,360
No, wait.

93
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:43,840
I didn't expect this nightmare.

94
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,720
If I'd known this would happen,

95
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,600
I'd have let the money go.

96
00:08:45,600 --> 00:08:46,270
Right?

97
00:08:47,790 --> 00:08:48,080
No.

98
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:51,270
You don't think I did this, do you?

99
00:08:52,270 --> 00:08:53,630
That's not for you to decide.

100
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:56,120
Come to CID later and give a statement.

101
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:56,720
Cooperate.

102
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:57,510
Officer,

103
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:58,550
I have things to do later.

104
00:08:58,550 --> 00:08:58,790
I...

105
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,510
I'm not asking.

106
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,360
I...

107
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:02,030
It's just a statement.

108
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:04,600
If I'd done it,

109
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:06,080
I wouldn't be standing here waiting,

110
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:06,870
right?

111
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,510
We've gone over the whole room.

112
00:09:15,630 --> 00:09:17,240
We'll complete the analysis
back at the lab.

113
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,150
Nothing missed, right?

114
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:23,720
No.

115
00:09:26,270 --> 00:09:26,960
That should be it.

116
00:09:31,870 --> 00:09:32,870
Has the inn owner arrived?

117
00:09:33,510 --> 00:09:34,120
I'll go check.

118
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:52,840
Hao Jun.

119
00:09:53,390 --> 00:09:53,750
Yes?

120
00:10:00,670 --> 00:10:01,790
You said nothing was missed.

121
00:10:03,150 --> 00:10:03,510
Ah.

122
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:04,240
Hey.

123
00:10:04,720 --> 00:10:05,150
Xiao Zhao.

124
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:05,840
Quick.

125
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:06,750
Bring a chair over.

126
00:10:27,440 --> 00:10:28,720
Pinhole camera.

127
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:30,840
Those little punks.

128
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:38,600
Captain Ren.

129
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:39,360
Yes?

130
00:10:40,910 --> 00:10:41,720
The guesthouse owner's here.

131
00:10:43,790 --> 00:10:44,510
Sorry.

132
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,510
I live pretty far away.

133
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:46,550
You're the owner?

134
00:10:47,240 --> 00:10:47,790
Yes.

135
00:10:48,360 --> 00:10:51,000
All the neighboring units
on this floor are mine.

136
00:10:51,790 --> 00:10:53,790
Guests are required to register
under their real names.

137
00:10:53,870 --> 00:10:54,600
Surely you knew.

138
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:57,000
Look, now we have a major case.

139
00:10:57,440 --> 00:10:58,270
Yet there are no records.

140
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:00,390
Do you know what you're liable for?

141
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:01,440
Oh...

142
00:11:01,790 --> 00:11:02,480
Officer.

143
00:11:02,870 --> 00:11:04,630
I did tell them to register.

144
00:11:04,790 --> 00:11:07,000
But Zou Jun was a long-term tenant.

145
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:09,270
When he brings someone back,

146
00:11:09,790 --> 00:11:11,270
I can't watch him all the time.

147
00:11:12,750 --> 00:11:14,600
You run a guesthouse
without even installing cameras?

148
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:18,270
The building's elevator has cameras.

149
00:11:18,630 --> 00:11:19,360
I was going to

150
00:11:19,630 --> 00:11:20,510
install another set myself.

151
00:11:20,750 --> 00:11:21,600
That would cost quite a bit.

152
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:24,790
They're all budget rooms.

153
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,120
It's a small business.

154
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,240
Go on.

155
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:31,080
How did this pinhole camera
end up in your room?

156
00:11:31,270 --> 00:11:31,600
This...

157
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,790
This is...

158
00:11:33,120 --> 00:11:34,150
Stop playing dumb.

159
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,120
You know what's in your room.

160
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,480
I don't know.

161
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:39,030
You can't pin this on me.

162
00:11:39,790 --> 00:11:40,910
If this gets out,

163
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:42,390
my business is done for.

164
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:45,840
Then tell the truth.

165
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:47,670
If we find out you're lying,

166
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:48,600
you'll pay for it.

167
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:53,870
Let's go.

168
00:12:06,150 --> 00:12:08,120
No trace was left
around the crime scene.

169
00:12:08,120 --> 00:12:08,960
What does that mean?

170
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:10,600
It means the killer planned this
well in advance.

171
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:11,870
Very careful.

172
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:12,790
Mm.

173
00:12:14,480 --> 00:12:15,390
Victim's background checked?

174
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:16,630
Yes.

175
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:17,720
Zou Jun...

176
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,270
Seven years ago, in an anti-gang sweep,

177
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:21,960
he was jailed
for procuring women for prostitution.

178
00:12:22,440 --> 00:12:23,840
After his release,
he had no fixed address

179
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:24,870
or steady work.

180
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,720
He's stayed here for nearly half a year.

181
00:12:28,630 --> 00:12:28,910
Thanks.

182
00:12:30,910 --> 00:12:32,480
This guy made plenty of sex videos.

183
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,870
We checked the inn owner's laptop.

184
00:12:41,630 --> 00:12:43,630
It doesn't look like
he installed the pinhole camera.

185
00:12:48,630 --> 00:12:49,720
Usually, these cameras

186
00:12:49,720 --> 00:12:52,270
upload their footage directly online.

187
00:12:52,670 --> 00:12:53,960
Even if he set it up,

188
00:12:53,960 --> 00:12:54,910
evidence would still be hard to obtain.

189
00:12:57,790 --> 00:12:59,600
Investigate revenge as the motive first.

190
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,150
A man like him must have complex ties.

191
00:13:03,390 --> 00:13:04,840
List everyone we can find.

192
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:06,000
We're short on people.

193
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,000
We must check them one by one.

194
00:13:09,200 --> 00:13:09,600
Captain Ren.

195
00:13:10,750 --> 00:13:11,960
We gathered camera data

196
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:13,200
from the nearby blocks.

197
00:13:13,510 --> 00:13:14,360
Which unit should handle it?

198
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:17,910
Master.

199
00:13:22,030 --> 00:13:22,270
Oh.

200
00:13:24,480 --> 00:13:24,870
Take a look.

201
00:13:25,670 --> 00:13:28,510
These days, it's all big-data analysis.

202
00:13:28,790 --> 00:13:30,480
And that requires intelligent systems.

203
00:13:33,670 --> 00:13:34,240
Manual work?

204
00:13:48,270 --> 00:13:49,240
This is called

205
00:13:50,480 --> 00:13:51,840
big-data analysis.

206
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:54,360
Fully manual.

207
00:13:57,200 --> 00:13:59,550
The city's traffic cameras

208
00:14:00,670 --> 00:14:02,750
have an effective range
of 30 to 50 meters.

209
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:06,550
So the only practical solution
is human review.

210
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:09,270
Watch each video one by one

211
00:14:09,510 --> 00:14:10,910
and look for suspicious people.

212
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:13,270
Throwing manpower at it works too.

213
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,960
But consider the cost

214
00:14:15,960 --> 00:14:18,790
and confidentiality concerns.

215
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:22,630
The approval process also takes time.

216
00:14:23,120 --> 00:14:24,120
So now,

217
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:25,270
the most effective way

218
00:14:25,270 --> 00:14:26,750
is to rely on...

219
00:14:27,720 --> 00:14:29,600
The best option is to let me sit here
and watch the videos.

220
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,270
Correct.

221
00:14:33,790 --> 00:14:35,150
You're the new guy, after all.

222
00:14:35,960 --> 00:14:38,750
You think being a top graduate
from the police academy

223
00:14:38,790 --> 00:14:39,790
means no grunt work?

224
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,030
Let me tell you,

225
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,200
when Ren Fei first put on the uniform,

226
00:14:44,200 --> 00:14:45,270
she had to do this too.

227
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:47,120
A little training never hurts.

228
00:14:49,550 --> 00:14:49,910
Uncle He.

229
00:14:50,270 --> 00:14:50,600
Mm.

230
00:14:50,910 --> 00:14:51,840
You trained Captain Ren too?

231
00:14:52,150 --> 00:14:52,600
Of course.

232
00:14:54,440 --> 00:14:55,870
She may be a young woman,

233
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,550
but among all my apprentices,

234
00:15:00,870 --> 00:15:02,120
she's the best.

235
00:15:04,670 --> 00:15:05,120
Work hard.

236
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,550
She has zero tolerance for mistakes.

237
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:08,150
Right.

238
00:15:08,910 --> 00:15:09,200
Okay.

239
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,480
We have far too little information.

240
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:21,030
The suspect is likely a woman,

241
00:15:21,670 --> 00:15:22,870
very strong,

242
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,120
and at least 1.7 meters tall.

243
00:15:25,120 --> 00:15:26,680
[Entrance to Fangman Guesthouse]

